parameters.description_zh:
透传参数。调用示例：
`  {
    "apiPassthrough": {
      "extensions": {
        "keyUsage": {
          "digitalSignature": true,
          "keyEncipherment": true
        },
        "extendedKeyUsages": ["serverAuth", "clientAuth"],
        "subjectAlternativeNames": [
          {"type": "dNSName", "value": "www.example.com"},
          {"type": "dNSName", "value": "example.com"},
          {"type": "iPAddress", "value": "192.168.1.1"}
        ],
        "criticals": ["ExtendedKeyUsages"]
      }
    }
  }`

